  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to 400 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together coconut cream, plain yogurt, lime juice, olive oil, garlic, ginger, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the chicken pieces to the bowl and marinate for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers.",
    "Grill the skewers for 10-12 minutes, turning occasionally.",
    "Let the skewers rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve with additional coconut cream sauce for dipping.",
    "Refrigerate or freeze for meal prep.",
    "Reheat to an internal temperature of 165 degrees Fahrenheit before serving."
